<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Monday 90,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Monday 90,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Estimated interior Iowa and southern Minnesota hog receipts Monday were 90,000 head, compared with 102,000 a week ago and 99,000 a year ago, USDA reported. Estimates include generally 65 percent carcass base hogs. Barrows and gilts were mostly $0.50 per cwt higher than midsession on Friday. Trade was moderate and demand and offerings was light to moderate.</p>
